<title>USA: Prudential cuts tech, raises bank weighting.</title>
<headline>Prudential cuts tech, raises bank weighting.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities chief strategist Greg Smith cut his weighting on technology by two percent and recommended those funds go to bank stocks, his office said.  </p>
<p>The strategist now recommends a 12 percent weighting in technology and a 10 percent financial stock weighting.</p>
</text>
